@@ -0,0 +1,305 @@
+# LICENSE
+#
+# _This file is Copyright 2018 by the Image Processing and Analysis Group (BioImage Suite Team). Dept. of Radiology & Biomedical Imaging, Yale School of Medicine._
+#
